sequenceDiagram
  participant P0 as Buyer
  participant P1 as Orders
  participant P2 as Database
  participant P3 as Payment
  P0->>P1: Checkout with key K
  P1->>P2: Commit order reservation and intent
  P2->>P1: Durable pending order
  P1->>P3: Pay with stable operation ID
  P3-->>P1: Response lost: outcome unknown
  P1->>P3: Query original operation
  P3->>P1: Confirmed result
  P1->>P2: Confirm order and outbox
  P1->>P0: Stable order state
